aigns Run promos, events and cashback for the customers you want to bring in and bring back. One QR at the counter Customers redeem at your counter with one QR code. Staff scanning Add your staff so they can scan and redeem customers’ claims for you. See who claimed See which customers claimed your rewards and when, by their Lucilla username. What you need to list Required Business name Category How you serve customers: in person, mobile or online What you offer, in one line Your street address (in person) or the area you cover (mobile) Optional Hours Website Photos and logo Socials Shows on the map Your business appears on the map and in the agent's results once you add a live deal or reward. A quick deal takes one line. 01 Get Ask Lucilla and sign in. 02 Open your account menu at the top and tap Create a business — or text or WhatsApp +1 (314) 237-4046 and the agent sets it up with you. 03 Add a quick deal. It takes one line. Listing your business costs nothing. Businesses you claim from can send you offers. You can unsubscribe anytime. Terms of Service Privacy Policy Community Rules Ask Lucilla Just ask. Lucilla finds it. Support Get the app For businesses Terms Privacy Community rules SMS terms Delete account support@lucilla.ca © 2026 Lucilla, Inc."
