r. STAY DINING WELLNESS MEETINGS CELEBRATIONS RECREATION STAY Stay Close to Nature. Experience refined comfort through our collection of villas and future hotel accommodations, set within the serene surroundings of the Ciater Highlands. DINING A Modern Taste of Indonesia. Discover modern Indonesian cuisine and relaxed dining experiences set within the natural surroundings of Bukit Ciater. WELLNESS Restore Your Body. Reconnect with Nature. Restore body and mind through natural hot spring experiences, spa and massage treatments, and spaces for relaxation and movement surrounded by nature. MEETINGS Where Business Meets the Highlands. Bring people and ideas together through executive meetings, corporate gatherings, retreats, and future MICE experiences in the cool surroundings of the Ciater Highlands. CELEBRATIONS Make Every Occasion a Destination. Create memorable moments through destination weddings, elegant celebrations, gala events, and special gatherings in a distinctive highland setting. RECREATION More Reasons to Stay, Play & Reconnect. Reconnect with nature through family-friendly activities, outdoor experiences, and refreshing moments surrounded by the beauty of the Ciater Highlands. EXPLORE THE DESTINATION Every View Reflects a Greater Vision. From quiet mornings in the highlands and private natural hot spring experiences to villa living, destination events, and future corporate gatherings, Bukit Ciater Resort is being developed as a place where nature, business, and lifestyle come together. BUKIT CIATER RESORT Bukit Ciater Resort is an integrated destination in the Ciater Highlands, bringing together nature, wellness, hospitality, villa ownership, dining, celebrations, corporate experiences, and leisure in one destination. Jl. Riung Rangga, Cisaat, Ciater Subang, Jawa Barat 41281 Indonesia Explore Home Villas Hotel Facilities Investment About Us Contact Us Privacy Policy © Copyright 2026 Bukit Ciater Resort"
