jakob-blei.com,0,"Naked Clarity | Clarity Coaching for Founders Direct 1:1 clarity coaching with Jakob Blei for founders and freelancers facing a difficult next move. Naked Clarity | Clarity Coaching for Founders Jakob Blei Clarity & Growth Coaching The work Publications Community Podcast Book Founders · Freelancers · High-achievers You built something real. So why are you still guessing? Direct 1:1 clarity coaching for people who need an honest answer about what comes next. Book a clarity session Naked Thoughts · Europe Scroll ↓ Who this is for You don't need fixing. You need room to think straight. 01 You're running on fumes The work gets done, but the energy behind it is gone. 02 There's a big decision Raise, pivot, hire, quit, go solo. You keep circling it. 03 You lost the why What you built no longer matches the reason you started. 04 You want someone who gets it Not a corporate coach. Someone who knows founder reality. How I work Three parts of the same conversation. The method The NAKED framework. N Name the truth What is actually happening? What are you avoiding? A Align your direction Choose the future that fits your business and life. K Know your numbers Runway, pricing, capacity, profitability and risk. E Engineer the strategy Clarify the offer, client, positioning and priorities. D Do the next brave thing Turn insight into commitments and action. About · How I work I ask the question you've been avoiding. I'm Jakob Blei, founder of NAKED THOUGHTS — a podcast and community connecting founders, creators and freelancers across Europe. After 6+ years in startup finance and fundraising, I know what the numbers look like when someone is quietly burning out behind them. You talk. I listen hard. Then I ask the thing nobody else does. We leave with decisions, not homework. Listen to the podcast Problems we attack The conversations you keep postponing. I want to leave employment, but I don't know whether my business is viable. I have too many ideas and cannot choose one. I have clients, but my offer and pricing are unclear. My business is growing, but I feel disconnected from it. I'm constantly comparing myself and questioning whether I'm good enough. I don't know whether to stay, pivot or shut the whole thing down. Featured in Ways to work together 01 90 minutes Clarity Intensive One decision. One deep conversation. Leave with a next step you can act on this week. €280 Founding price €180 Book now 02 6 weeks · Core offer The Reset Rebuild the why, the shape of the work and the way you spend your weeks. €2,200 Founding price €1,500 Book now 03 Coming soon Small Group Cohort A handful of founders and freelancers. Same room, same honest questions. Email address Join waiting list One honest conversation Ready to stop guessing? Start with a free 15-minute fit call. No pitch, no prep. You'll know whether this is worth your time. Book a free fit call Jakob Blei · Vienna / Madrid Podcast Email Free 15-min fit call"
