konicoin.com,0,"Konicoin - Follow the fox KONI is the Base token supporting KoniOS, an independent operating system in development. Explore the project, token details, and official resources. Konicoin - Follow the fox Skip to content konicoin The project Token details Resources View on Uniswap MEET KONICOIN ON BASE A little wild. All Konicoin. The support coin for KoniOS. An independent operating system in the making. Explore on Uniswap Token details + ON BASE FOLLOW THE FOX KONICOIN / ORIGINAL EMBLEM 01 — THE BEGINNING ▰ ▰ ▰ ▱ ▱ KONICOIN ✳ FOLLOW THE FOX ✳ KONICOIN ✳ FOLLOW THE FOX ✳ 01 / THE PROJECT One coin. A bigger project. Konicoin is the support coin for KoniOS: an independent, experimental 64-bit operating system. The project explores how an OS works from the first boot to the programs you run, with its own bootloader, kernel, and command shell. Its developing toolset includes a text editor and a small C-like compiler. KoniOS remains a work in progress, with a focus on understanding and building the system from the ground up. KONI lives on Base as its support coin. HOW DEVELOPMENT IS SUPPORTED Supporting the work behind KoniOS. The creator intends to use fees earned from their KONI liquidity position on Uniswap to help fund KoniOS development and sustain the independent work behind the project. These are liquidity-provider fees earned when swaps use the position's active liquidity. They are separate from the KONI token contract and vary with trading activity, the position's share of active liquidity, and protocol fees. View the creator's liquidity position 02 / KNOW THE TOKEN The details matter. EXPLORE ON BASESCAN 0 1 Network Base 0 2 Ticker KONI 0 3 Total supply 100,000,000 0 4 Market Uniswap OFFICIAL CONTRACT / BASE 0x619c0012132Ece023005B6A2ed1AD47305c2e63d Copy address 03 / FROM THE SOURCE Go straight to the source. The token. The chain. The original fox. EXPLORE THE TOKEN ↗ Find us on Uniswap. View Konicoin’s token page and available market information on Base. OPEN UNISWAP ↗ ONCHAIN INFORMATION ● See it onchain. Inspect the token contract and its onchain activity using BaseScan. OPEN BASESCAN ↗ OFFICIAL BRAND ASSET The Konicoin emblem. The original fox, ready to share. Download our transparent PNG logo. DOWNLOAD LOGO ↓ THE COMMUNITY STARTS HERE Good things take a little time. Official social channels are on the way. We will link them here when they are ready. THIS IS ONLY THE BEGINNING. Follow the fox. konicoin © 2026 Konicoin Verify the token Always verify the network and contract address before interacting with a token."
