lega.is,0,"LEGA — Mannvirkjahönnun & merkjalýsingar LEGA — Mannvirkjahönnun & merkjalýsingar LEGA MANNVIRKJAHÖNNUN · MERKJALÝSINGAR Þjónusta Ferlið Um LEGA Fyrirspurn Hafa samband LEGA — MANNVIRKJAHÖNNUN · MERKJALÝSINGAR Frá mörkum til mannvirkis LEGA veitir sérhæfða þjónustu í mannvirkjahönnun og merkjalýsingum — með áherslu á aðaluppdrætti, verkteikningar og deililausnir arkitekta. Senda fyrirspurn Skoða þjónustu Hönnun og teikningar mannvirkja Merkjalýsingar og afmörkun fasteigna Útsetning lóða og byggingarreita BIM, útboðsgögn og byggingarstjórn Þjónusta Hvað get ég aðstoðað með? Veldu einstaka þjónustu eða fáðu aðstoð við verkefnið í heild. Hönnun & teikningar Mannvirkjahönnun með áherslu á aðaluppdrætti, verkteikningar og deililausnir arkitekta. Frumhönnun og ráðgjöf Aðaluppdrættir Verkteikningar og deililausnir arkitekta Viðbyggingar og breytingar Uppmæling og uppteiknun Þrívíddar- og BIM-líkön Skráningartöflur Merkjalýsingar Afmörkun fasteigna og frágangur gagna í samræmi við gildandi kröfur. Nýjar merkjalýsingar Breytingar á eignamörkum Stofnun eða skipting landeigna Fullnaðarskráning Útsetning lóða og byggingarreita Útsetning samkvæmt fyrirliggjandi og samþykktum hönnunargögnum. Útsetning lóða Útsetning byggingarreita Ráðgjöf & framkvæmd Aðstoð við samræmingu, útboð og framkvæmd byggingarverkefna. BIM-stjórnun og samræming Verklýsingar og tilboðsskrár Magntaka og kostnaðaráætlanir Byggingarstjórn Ferlið Einfalt frá fyrstu fyrirspurn. 1. Segðu frá verkefninu Stutt lýsing, staðsetning og hvaða þjónustu þú telur þig þurfa. 2. Umfang metið Farið er yfir gögn, forsendur og hvað þarf til að vinna verkið rétt. 3. Næstu skref Þú færð tillögu að verkferli og verðtilboði áður en vinna hefst. Um LEGA Fagþekking frá hugmynd að fullbúnum hönnunargögnum Að baki LEGA er byggingarfræðingur og húsasmíðameistari með áralanga reynslu af mannvirkjagerð og störfum á arkitektastofu Bakgrunnur í bæði hönnun og framkvæmdum skilar hagnýtum lausnum þar sem horft er til verkefnisins í heild – frá fyrstu hugmynd að fullbúnum hönnunargögnum. LEGA sinnir jafnframt merkjalýsingum ásamt útsetningu lóða og byggingarreita og getur því tekið að sér fjölbreytt verkefni tengd fasteignum, lóðum og mannvirkjum. Byggingarfræðingur · Húsasmíðameistari · Merkjalýsandi · Byggingarstjóri Fyrirspurn Ertu með verkefni í undirbúningi? Sendu stutta lýsingu á verkefninu. Engin skuldbinding fylgir fyrirspurn. Nafn Netfang Þjónusta Hönnun & teikningar Merkjalýsing Útsetning lóðar / byggingarreits Byggingarstjórn / ráðgjöf Annað Lýsing á verkefni Senda fyrirspurn © LEGA · Mannvirkjahönnun & merkjalýsingar · lega.is"
legacy-dental-group.com,0,"Legacy Dental Group, Site 1 | Home in Glendale Glendale dentist, Legacy Dental Group, Site 1 is a local, trusted dental practice offering general and cosmetic dentistry, teeth whitening, implants, veneers & other dental care. Call today to make an appointment! Legacy Dental Group, Site 1 | Home in Glendale Home Our Practice First Visit Meet Dr. Core Our Office Join Our Team Services Cleaning & Prevention Family Dentistry Cosmetic Dentistry Sedation Dentistry Tooth Replacement Extractions & Preservation Oral Appliances Technology New/Existing Patients Pre and Post Op Instructions Financial Options Membership Plan Patient Education Payment Book Now Direction Call Now 6029934200 Home Our Practice First Visit Meet Dr. Core Our Office Join Our Team Services Cleaning & Prevention Family Dentistry Cosmetic Dentistry Sedation Dentistry Tooth Replacement Extractions & Preservation Oral Appliances Technology New/Existing Patients Pre and Post Op Instructions Financial Options Membership Plan Patient Education Payment (602) 993-4200 Book Online Home Our Practice First Visit Meet Dr. Core Our Office Join Our Team Services Cleaning & Prevention Family Dentistry Cosmetic Dentistry Sedation Dentistry Tooth Replacement Extractions & Preservation Oral Appliances Technology New/Existing Patients Pre and Post Op Instructions Financial Options Membership Plan Patient Education Payment (602) 993-4200 Book Online A Standard of Excellence in Dental Care Book Online A Positive Experience Book Online A Highly Trained and Skilled Team Book Online A Standard of Excellence in Dental Care Book Online A Positive Experience Book Online Previous 1 2 3 Next Meet The Doctor Directions Book Online New/Existing Patients Why Choose Us? Legacy Dental Group is more than just a dental office. It is an idea built on Dr. Louis Core's vision of what a patient experience should be. An experience that most patients have never encountered before walking through our doors. Our mission is simple. We believe our patient’s oral and overall health is our first priority. Our goal is to build long-lasting relationships with each and every patient we see, and as a team, achieve the goal of healthy and happy smiles. When you visit Legacy Dental Group you should expect a warm and inviting team of dental experts at every stage of your visit. Our team goes above and beyond to ensure that every patient is treated with the utmost respect, feels welcome, and understands their dental needs. As a team, we strive to ensure that you are receiving the best dental care that we can provide. Book Online General Dentistry Dentistry encompasses array of services and procedures with a common goal: to help you to preserve your natural teeth, ensure your oral health, and keep you looking and feeling great. Learn More Cosmetic Dentistry For these and many other reasons, esthetic dentistry has become a vital and important part of the dental profession. Learn More Sedation Dentistry Sedation dentistry uses medication to help you feel more calm and relaxed during your dental procedure. Sometimes called conscious sedation dentistry, you will experience forgetfulness and insensitivity to pain all while still being conscious. Sedation dentistry can be used on patients of all ages. Learn More Send Us A Message Error! Close Our Location -- mi Legacy Dental Group Address 18205 N 51st Ave Ste 101 Glendale, AZ 85308-1491, US Contact Information (602) 993-4200 Stay Connected Follow us today for exclusive promotions Copyright © 2026 MH Sub I, LLC dba Officite Admin Log In Site Map Privacy Policy Hipaa Policy Terms Of Use"
legacygrovehwe.org,0,"Hershey West End continues the community-building legacy of Milton S. Hershey with small businesses, outdoor amenities, and beautiful homes. See more. How to Stay Informed About Hershey West End • An Exciting Season for Hershey West End • Celebrating the People Who Build Strong Communities • Read More ► Commercial Residential Outdoors Location News About Find Your Place For Commercial Development Find Your Place For Single-Family Development Find Your Place For Community Gathering A Tradition of Building Community Continues There are places we go again and again because every visit brings a new experience. A great meal, a sunset bike ride, the change in energy from day to night. Hershey West End is becoming just such a place. Hershey West End is designed to continue the community-building legacy of Milton S. Hershey with Main Street-style retail and restaurants, wonderful gathering spaces, connected outdoor amenities, and beautiful homes. Something to do Head for the West Whether it’s your morning cup of joe or your go-to place to meet friends, you’ll soon find it in this community. The Farmhouse at Englewood Hershey is already a favorite destination, as is our existing trail network. Outdoors Retail Restaurants What's New We’ll soon have lots of reasons to invite you to Hershey West End. Sign up to be notified when new businesses open! Sign Up ► A place to call home Live Life Well If you love the idea of walking to great shops, restaurants, or work, Hershey West End is the neighborhood for you. Beautiful homes, thoughtfully designed around calming green spaces, will be available for purchase soon. Work, stay & play A Wealth of Opportunity Hershey Inn & Suites is now open to serve visitors to Hershey. Hershey West End also has plans for office space to serve professionals at the Penn State Health Milton S. Hershey Medical Center and the surrounding community. Office Space Hotel Because great places don’t just happen–they become. WE invite you to join us. Register for the Latest Updates: Facebook This field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged. Email (Required) Submit © 2026 Hershey West End. All rights reserved. Illustrations are an artist’s depiction; actual plans may vary and are subject to change without notice. Contact Us ► MHSKids.org HersheyLegacy.org"
