leopardustilcayo.lol,0,"Tigrino: the only known Leopardus tilcayo, Bolivia&#x27;s new cat species The only known cat of Leopardus tilcayo, the first new cat species in 100 years. Raised at La Senda Verde sanctuary, Bolivia. $100K+ donated by the $TIGRINO community, live counter. Tigrino: the only known Leopardus tilcayo, Bolivia's new cat species Tigrino 😾 Story Ledger Coin @tigrinoonrh $TIGRINO Field guide · Specimen 001 · Yungas, Bolivia First new cat species in 103 years Tigrino . The only known member of a species science found last week. Three pounds. Lives in a Bolivian sanctuary. In the 48 hours after the news broke, strangers sent that sanctuary over $100,000. It feeds him, and the thousand other rescued animals he lives with. Read the story I’m here for the coin Donate directly Tigrino in his enclosure, 18 Sep 2026 Covered by National Geographic Reuters The New York Times BBC NBC News ABC News + press kit 01 / The specimen Smaller than your cat. Older than our species. Everything below is from the paper, National Geographic, or the sanctuary. Nothing is estimated by us. Species Leopardus tilcayo Common name Tilcayo tiger cat Known individuals 1 Weight 1.4 kg · 3 lb Length 46 cm · 18 in Age ≈ 10 years Range Yungas cloud forest, Bolivia Diverged ≈ 1.4 million years ago Described 17 Sep 2026, Current Biology Previous new cat Pampas cat, 1923 Photo: La Senda Verde 02 / The story Nine years in a sanctuary before anyone knew what he was. 2016 A man finds a kitten on a road in the Yungas and takes it home. He thinks it's a house cat. 2017 It isn't. He brings it to La Senda Verde. Staff assume a common tiger cat and name him Tigrino. A biologist comes to look and takes a hundred photos. 2019 Writing a field guide, she notices his spots match nothing from Brazil. “This is so wrong.” 2020–26 Thirty-eight genomes across the genus. His line split from every other tiger cat 1.4 million years ago. 17 Sep 2026 Leopardus tilcayo is published. First new cat species in 103 years. Tigrino is the only one known to exist. 18 Sep 2026 $TIGRINO launches with 100% of its creator fees locked to his sanctuary. By evening the sanctuary posts a thank-you. 19 Sep 2026 $100,000 crossed. His keeper prints a sign. “Tigrino” trends on X by name. His name Tigrino Given by the sanctuary in 2017, years before anyone knew he mattered. His species Tilcayo From the word Yungas locals have always used. Nobody knows what it means. 03 / The sanctuary La Senda Verde. Founded 2003. One thousand rescued animals. One of them is famous now. 04 / The ledger Every dollar below is a public transaction. It feeds more than one cat. Trading fees from $TIGRINO are locked to the sanctuary’s US charity and settled by donate.gg. It pays for Tigrino’s care and for the 1,000+ animals La Senda Verde has rescued from trafficking. The sanctuary never touches crypto. This number is read live from their ledger. Delivered to La Senda Verde · Tigrino + 1,000 rescued animals live · donate.gg $119,804 ETH 1106.0 Donations 50 From $TIGRINO fees 100% Last transfer 39m ago Show recent transfers $TIGRINO creator fees 56.93 ETH 39m ago $TIGRINO creator fees 31.05 ETH 12h ago Gato-do-Mato 0.00 ETH 15h ago $TIGRINO creator fees 15.35 ETH 17h ago $TIGRINO creator fees 59.10 ETH 18h ago $TIGRINO creator fees 2.26 ETH 20h ago $TIGRINO creator fees 0.01 ETH 21h ago $TIGRINO creator fees 7.05 ETH 21h ago $TIGRINO creator fees 0.00 ETH 22h ago $TIGRINO creator fees 6.57 ETH 22h ago $TIGRINO creator fees 5.13 ETH 23h ago $TIGRINO creator fees 26.05 ETH 24h ago Source: donate.gg · La Senda Verde Animal Refuge Inc · EIN 47-2415812 · fee wallet on Blockscout 05 / The coin You trade. He eats. Nobody has to be trusted. A memecoin with one unusual property: the person who made it can’t get paid. Fees are routed on-chain to a sanctuary that cares for Tigrino and a thousand other rescued animals, and the route is locked. Contract · Robinhood Chain 0x42b3764c47360667b7f2973701da77ab2c29fc9a copy Fee to sanc