localeats.online,0,"LocalEats — Find Where Local Food Makers Are Stocked LocalEats maps small local food producers and every corner shop, deli or Spar that carries their food — not just their own front door. LocalEats — Find Where Local Food Makers Are Stocked Local Eats Map & Directory Add a stockist Local Kitchens. Every Shop That Stocks Them. Small local food makers often sell from their own kitchen and through a handful of local shops — and one shop can carry several different producers at once. LocalEats maps both directions: find a producer's full stockist network, or find out everything a corner shop near you actually carries. Run a local kitchen, or know a shop that stocks one? Add it . Search 📍 Use my location Browse by producer Also on a shared shelf Own stockists only Loading shops… Run a local kitchen, or a shop that stocks one? Tell us which shops carry your food — or which local producers your shop stocks — via the submission form . Local Eats — community-submitted local food makers and the shops that stock them. Details are community-submitted — always confirm stock and opening hours with the shop before travelling."
