ripe.net,0,"Welcome to RIPE and the RIPE NCC &mdash; RIPE Network Coordination Centre The RIPE NCC is one of five Regional Internet Registries (RIRs) providing Internet resource allocation and registration, and coordination activities. Welcome to RIPE and the RIPE NCC — RIPE Network Coordination Centre Skip to main content IPs & ASNs IPs & ASNs We distribute Internet number resources to our members and provide tools to help them manage their allocations and assignments. Visit page IPv4 Request /24 Allocation IPv4 Run-out How Does The IPv4 Waiting List Work? IPv4 Transfer Request IPv4 Waiting List IPv6 Request IPv6 IPv6 Info Centre AS Numbers Reassigning Referenced AS Numbers RIPE Database Whois Search Webupdates Database Support LIR Portal DNS Reverse DNS DNSSEC Resource Transfers and Mergers Inter-RIR Transfers Mergers and Acquisitions Legacy Internet Resources Documentation Documentation for Resource Management Resource Public Key Infrastructure (RPKI) Policy Implementation Assisted Registry Check Close Analyse Analyse We collect a wide range of Internet data and provide statistics and tools you can use for your own operations and analyses. Visit page Statistics Internet Measurements RIPE Atlas RIPEstat RIS RIPE IPMap Internet Traffic Maps Analyses and Use Cases IXP Country Jedi (Alpha) DNS K-root AuthDNS Reverse DNS Zonecheck DNS Monitoring Service (DNSMON) Raw Datasets RIPE Atlas Raw Data Format RIPE Atlas Raw Data RIS Raw Data Terms and Conditions Archived Projects RIS Tools and Web Interfaces TTM RRCC DISI IRRToolset Re-implementation Project DBConstat Sponsorship Close Community Community More information about RIPE Visit page Working Groups Working Group Chairs Active Working Groups Task Forces Policy Development Policy Implementation Status Current Policy Proposals Internet Governance Internet Technical Community Multi-stakeholder Engagement Internet Governance News RIPE Labs NRO NC About the NRO NC NRO NC Nominations - October 2025 ICP-2 Review Initiatives