he first ""hi"" to a tracked delivery, every step happens where your customer already is. 01 Inquiry A customer messages your business on WhatsApp — asking about stock, price, or sizing. 02 Conversion SEMA answers instantly, recommends products, and guides them toward checkout. 03 Payment The customer pays by M-PESA, card, or crypto — directly inside the chat, no redirect. 04 Fulfillment SEMA dispatches the delivery request and shares tracking, all without you touching a spreadsheet. Native to WhatsApp Deploy it your way. SEMA doesn't ask you to migrate anywhere. It joins the number your customers already message. Join your group chats Add SEMA to an existing WhatsApp group and it starts answering product questions immediately, alongside you. Take over a business or personal number Hand SEMA your storefront's WhatsApp number and it manages the full conversation, end to end. SEMA is handling this ""Do you deliver to Kisumu, and how much?"" — answered in 2 seconds. Escalated to you ""Can I get this at a discount for a bulk order of 40 units?"" Needs merchant judgment — SEMA paused and notified you. Back to SEMA Once you reply with the discounted price, SEMA resumes and closes the sale. Getting started Adding SEMA is a chat, not a project. No developer, no migration, no downtime. You send three messages and SEMA is answering your customers. 1 Message SEMA your WhatsApp number The one your customers already message — personal or business, doesn't matter. 2 SEMA reads your catalog Send a price list, past chats, or your Instagram — SEMA learns what you sell and how you talk to customers. 3 You're live SEMA starts answering new inquiries immediately, and flags anything it's unsure about straight to you. S Setting up SEMA typically takes under 10 minutes Add SEMA to my shop 👋 Sure — send the WhatsApp number you sell from. +254 7XX XXX XXX Got it. Reading your catalog and past chats now… You're live — SEMA is answering new inquiries. Pricing Free for your first month. Join the waitlist now and get SEMA free for your first month once you're onboarded — no card required. Waitlist member perk KES 0 for your first month This offer is reserved for merchants who join the waitlist before launch. After your"
