stilltraxkaraokegrillandbar.com,0,"Still Trax Karaoke Grill and bar Still Trax Karaoke Grill and bar Skip to main content Still Trax Karaoke Grill and bar Still Trax Karaoke Grill and bar Home Food & Drinks Menu Events & Entertainment Welcome to your new favorite neighborhood hangout Serving up Great bar food daily and hearty country food special nights, ice-cold drinks and signature cocktails (like Pops tea, our take on a Long Island Tea) nightly, karaoke nights, music bingo and friendly 8 ball pool table tournaments right here in Lawrenceburg, Kentucky. Explore the menu See upcoming events Good food, great drinks, and endless fun Step into our laid-back Cheers-style atmosphere where everybody knows your name and there is always something exciting on the schedule. Country food specials Savor authentic down-home cooking on special nights that are both comforting and hearty. Our menu has lots of choices of daily items such as pork tenderloin sandwiches, hand breaded chicken tenders. Several styles of burgers including a beer cheese burger with several side choices, wings, and more. Pictured some of past offerings (some pictured are half plates). View dinner specials Classic grill and bar bites Pair your cold beer or signature cocktail with juicy burgers, crispy wings, loaded appetizers, and craveable pub classics including our beer cheese burger. View grill menu Karaoke and music bingo Take center stage under the lights, sing your heart out, or test your music knowledge every Tuesday with Music Bingo for great prizes and laughs. Check event calendar Pool tournaments and special event Cornhole tournaments Join a tournament Rack 'em up for our weekly pool tournaments, challenge friends to casual matches, and enjoy a welcoming community spirit. ""Still Trax feels just like walking into Cheers. The home-cooked specials hit the spot every single time, and the karaoke nights are pure fun!"" Local regular in Lawrenceburg Pull up a chair and make yourself at home Whether you are coming in for beer with coworkers, family dinner specials, or a late-night karaoke session with friends, there is always a seat waiting for you at Still Trax. View food and drink specials Common questions about our grill and bar Here is everything you need to know before visiting Still Trax Karaoke Grill and bar in Lawrenceburg, Kentucky. What nights do you have karaoke? Wednesdays and Thursdays karaoke starts at 7 goes til 10 Fridays and Saturdays karaoke starts at 7 goes til 130 am Sundays karaoke will start at 5 and go to close. What nights are your 8 ball pool tournaments held? 8 ball tournaments are held on Thursdays at 7pm. What night is music bingo? Music Bingo is 7 pm on Tuesday evenings Name * Email address * Message * Leave this field empty Submit form Visit us Still Trax Karaoke Grill and bar 1255 Harrodsburg Rd Lawrenceburg, KY 40342 Opening hours Tue - Thu: 3pm - 11pm Fri - Sat: 11am - 2am Sun: 3pm - 10pm. Starting 9/20/26 Mon: Closed Get in touch 5028596050 STILLTRAX.COM Facebook Follow the fun Create Your Own Website With Webador © 2026 Still Trax Karaoke Grill and bar Powered by Webador"
stockpickr.fun,0,"STOCKPICKR · where the picks get paid Buy a tokenized stock, then pick it. Trading is free, and a quarter of the trading fees on our coin goes to the pickers whose picks actually work. STOCKPICKR · where the picks get paid Stock pickr How it works FAQ Docs CA: soon Download App Login 25 % of coin fees go to the pickers Get Paid To Pick Tokenized Stocks Buy a tokenized stock, then pick it. Trading here is free, and a quarter of the trading fees on our coin goes to the pickers whose picks actually work. The better the pick, the bigger the cut. Your track record is public, on-chain, and yours. Start trading Download App never miss the pick again the only social-first stock trading app LEADERBOARD become a legend, top the leaderboard 1 sightline @sightline +$12,480.55 2 vega @vega.gm +$8,306.20 3 merit @merit_daily +$5,122.80 4 quill @quillpicks +$4,765.00 FEED discover and follow top pickers sightline Pick 5m networking segment still isn't priced in NVDAx · Long $23.2K +14.3% ♥ 293 8,492 3 older vega Buy 12m added $34.3K HOODx at $98.22 ALERTS real time pings when the best are buying NVDAx is up 4.2% 9:41 AM 50 top pickers bought $88,203.12 REWARDS TREASURY 25 % of the fees of our coin goes to the rewards pool 0 % to pickers Picker Rewards treasury Stockpickr coin fees Treasury wallet, on-chain Not yet ONE CLICK TO BUY fund with your wallet Buy Sell $ 25 $10 $100 $500 $1000 $3,563.34 available No fee Order $25.00 Stockpickr fee None Attribution @sightline Total $25.00 Buy NVDAx How it works Pick it. Own it. Get paid. 3 steps · scroll 01 Buy the stock Every tokenized stock trades around the clock with live on-chain pricing. Buy it with Robinhood ETH and the swap settles straight into your own wallet. 02 Make the pick Holding it is what earns you the right to pick it, so every thesis has real money behind it. Yours is stamped at the current price and on your public record from that second. 03 Get paid 25% of every trading fee lands in the Picker Rewards pool, then goes out to the picks that earned it: how the pick performed, how many real people acted on it, and how much trading it drove. Common questions The short version of how the money moves. How do pickers get paid? Trading on Stockpickr is free. The rewards come from the coin instead: 25% of the trading fees on the Stockpickr coin is sent to a treasury wallet on Robinhood Chain, and that wallet is the Picker Rewards pool. It pays the pickers whose picks were right, judged against how the market itself moved over the same period, so a pick carried along by a general rally earns nothing. A pick that goes down earns nothing. Follower count on its own earns nothing either. Are the stocks real? Every market is a stock tokenized 1:1, priced off the underlying market and settled on-chain. You're buying exposure to the actual equity, nothing here is simulated. What makes a pick eligible? It has to exist before the move, attract real viewers, and clear a minimum level of genuine activity. One reward-eligible pick per stock per cooldown window, you can post more, but spam doesn't stack rewards. Can whales or bots farm the pool? Volume earns with diminishing returns, attention is counted in unique users rather than raw impressions, and fraud checks run before any payout. Wash trading, sybil accounts, and coordinated engagement score zero, or get the account flagged out entirely. Do I need to be right to earn? Performance counts, but it doesn't dominate. A pick that genuinely surfaces a stock early and brings real traders can still earn if the move is modest, the pool rewards market discovery, not just prediction. When do payouts land? Once eligibility and fraud checks finish, rewards go straight to your wallet. No claims process, no waiting on us. Stock pickr CA: soon © 2026 Stockpickr Labs . PRODUCT Trade How it works FAQ Docs SOCIAL X / Twitter LEGAL Privacy Policy Terms of Service"
