d enclosed bath 03 Full-width, 4-foot-deep front porch 04 Coordinated siding and interior finish concepts Download the regional style guide ↗ Space to settle in. Tell us what home looks like to you. Your place. Your next chapter. Tell Sundello where you’re planning to build, which roofline you prefer, and which finish feels like you. Ask about pricing, available finishes, and the next steps for your project. Download the regional style guide ↗ Five regional palettes, illustrated with flat-roof exterior and interior concepts. Looking for workforce housing? Meet Sundello Outpost ↗ Meet Sundello Haven ↗ sundello Origin 320 · Flat & pitched roofs Concept imagery. Footprint dimensions exclude the porch. Confirm final specifications, site requirements, and availability with Sundello. Close ×"
