tapemetry.com,0,"tapemetry — orderflow charting for crypto Orderflow charting for crypto, built on a single clock. Liquidity heatmap, footprint, DOM — every number with its source. tapemetry — orderflow charting for crypto tape metry How we measure What we don’t do Data EN DE Request access PRIVATE BETA · INVITE ONLY Orderflow charting for crypto, built on a single clock. Liquidity heatmap, footprint, DOM, iceberg detection and a backtester that runs against the recorded book. Six venues, one composite. Replay returns the same bytes as live. Below: a recorded moment from our archive, read-only. tape metry BTCUSDT composite LAYOUT Orderflow RECORDED 25.08. 13:31 UTC BTC /USDT composite · 2 venues 1m Candles Indicators 3 DERIVED QUANTITIES · NO RAW QUOTES LIVE REPLAY ✛ ╱ ▭ ◠ ⌇ ⇱ ≡ ⌗ Heatmap rank VWAP +11.0 bp CVD −4.4 % SWEEP · 2 VENUES · 467 FILLS / 40 ms ONE LEVEL · +6.82 bp 13:31:00 offered 76.5 BTC traded 28.5 BTC hidden — Click a number — it shows its source. 13:00 13:10 13:20 13:31 +49.5 +40.5 +31.6 +22.7 +13.8 +4.9 −4.1 −13.0 0 bp Book Layers Events Alerts BID % BP ASK % +4.0 +3.5 3.4 +3.0 5.9 +2.5 0.5 +2.0 2.6 +1.5 3.1 +1.0 4.1 +0.5 5.7 33.6 −0.5 20.1 −1.0 21.1 −1.5 −2.0 −2.5 −3.0 −3.5 −4.0 SPREAD 0.01 bp BID 75 % Layouts Orderflow · 1 binance · bybit LAT 91 ms TRADES 247 814 Recording 25.08.2026 13:00–13:31 UTC · Binance + Bybit BTCUSDT perp · prices shown as distance to the 13:31 close in basis points, depth as share Request access → How we measure → VENUES BINANCE RECORDED BYBIT RECORDED OKX RECORDED HYPERLIQUID RECORDED COINBASE RECORDED DERIBIT RECORDED CME PLANNED POLYMARKET PLANNED BINANCE RECORDED BYBIT RECORDED OKX RECORDED HYPERLIQUID RECORDED COINBASE RECORDED DERIBIT RECORDED CME PLANNED POLYMARKET PLANNED WHAT’S INSIDE The full desk. Every piece on the same tape. Liquidity heatmap Resting orders over days, from our own archive. Three channels: shown, turnover, load-bearing. Footprint & DOM Aggressor side per fill, not estimated from tick rule. Queue position on the button, as a range. Iceberg detection Hidden size as an accounting identity: traded minus ever offered. Venue-by-venue confidence. Big trades & sweeps Size as a percentile of the last hour, cross-venue sweeps within 40 ms, absorbed or followed. Backtester Fills from the recorded book, both queue bounds, fees from the dated schedule. A trial counter that raises the bar. Replay Any moment, byte-identical to what live showed. Scrub, step, compare two windows. PROVENANCE Every number has a source. Click one. Measured, derived or third-party — every value carries its origin, its timestamp and its assumptions. Including the ones on this page. 1 The same moment, live and replay LIVE REPLAY recording · 13:00–13:31 UTC · buy share per minute Snapshots can’t do this: between two captures the ordering is gone, and replay becomes a retelling. 2 Click any number Trades 247 814 Buy share 47.8 % Tick size 0.1 USDT DERIVED Buy volume ÷ total volume. Assumes the venue’s aggressor flag is correct. Measured, derived or third-party — with source and timestamp. Nobody else can, because nobody else carries provenance through. 3 Approach a level OFFERED 76.5 TRADED 28.5 HIDDEN — BTC · 13:26–13:31 UTC · neighbours 1 tick apart Offered, traded, hidden. Without book deltas the third number doesn’t exist — you see a level shrink, not why. WHAT WE DON’T DO Four things missing here. On purpose. No signals. We don’t say what to buy. The terminal shows state and consequence; the decision is yours. No scores. No “buy pressure 73”. A distribution, or nothing. No AI opinion. Models translate text into rules and read them back. They rate nothing, suggest nothing, produce no number. Small samples say so. Below n = 30 you see ◐ instead of a number. That’s an answer we’re glad to give. WHAT WE COMPUTE WITH Six venues. And per venue, what is actually measurable there. MEASURABLE BINANCE BYBIT DERIBIT HYPERLIQ. Aggressor side Book depth per level Maker identity per fill Liquidations silent claimed no feed Turnover at level measured derived not present feed silent BOOK Recorded since 08.2026, deltas per update · 64 MB ring per tab, live TRADES Since 08.2026, six ve"
