unitutils.com,0,"UnitUtils – Free Unit and Measurement Converters Fast, accurate unit converters: kg to lbs, feet to metres, miles to km, Celsius to Fahrenheit and more. Free, with the formula and working shown. UnitUtils – Free Unit and Measurement Converters Skip to content Unit Utils Dark theme Menu Length Weight Volume Temperature Speed All converters Unit & Measurement Converters Convert length, weight, volume, temperature, speed and more. Instant, exact and free. Search converters Popular conversions Kilograms to Pounds Pounds to Kilograms Feet to Metres Inches to Centimetres Centimetres to Inches Miles to Kilometres Kilometres to Miles Miles per Hour to Kilometres per Hour Litres to US Gallons Celsius to Fahrenheit Fahrenheit to Celsius All converters Every category has a converter for any pair of its units. The conversions people ask for most have a page of their own, with the formula, a table and worked examples. Length Converter Convert between millimetres, centimetres, metres, kilometres, inches, feet, yards, miles and nautical miles. Feet to Metres Metres to Feet Inches to Centimetres Centimetres to Inches Miles to Kilometres Kilometres to Miles Weight and Mass Converter Convert between milligrams, grams, kilograms, tonnes, ounces, pounds, stones and US or imperial tons. Kilograms to Pounds Pounds to Kilograms Kilograms to Stones Stones to Kilograms Volume Converter Convert between millilitres, litres and the US and imperial fluid ounces, cups, pints, quarts and gallons. Litres to US Gallons US Gallons to Litres Temperature Converter Convert between degrees Celsius, degrees Fahrenheit and kelvins. Celsius to Fahrenheit Fahrenheit to Celsius Area Converter Convert between square metres, square feet, acres, hectares and other units of area. Speed Converter Convert between metres per second, kilometres per hour, miles per hour, feet per second and knots. Miles per Hour to Kilometres per Hour Kilometres per Hour to Miles per Hour Time Converter Convert between milliseconds, seconds, minutes, hours, days and weeks, and average months and years. Data Storage Converter Convert between bits, bytes and the decimal (kB, MB, GB, TB) and binary (KiB, MiB, GiB, TiB) units. Pressure Converter Convert between pascals, kilopascals, bars, atmospheres, PSI and millimetres of mercury. Energy Converter Convert between joules, kilojoules, calories, kilocalories, watt-hours, kilowatt-hours and BTU. Power Converter Convert between watts, kilowatts and horsepower. Force Converter Convert between newtons, kilonewtons and pounds-force. Angle Converter Convert between degrees, radians and gradians. Frequency Converter Convert between hertz, kilohertz, megahertz and gigahertz. Why use UnitUtils? Exact constants Each unit is defined the way the standards define it: the inch as exactly 25.4 mm, the pound as exactly 0.45359237 kg, the US and imperial gallon as different units. Every page shows the factor it uses. Private and instant Conversions run in your browser as you type. Nothing you enter is sent anywhere, and there is nothing to sign up for. Made for a phone Large controls, a number keypad, and a swap button. Every page works with a keyboard and a screen reader, and the results can be copied. Conversions with their own page Kilograms to Pounds Convert kilograms to pounds quickly and accurately. Pounds to Kilograms Convert pounds to kilograms quickly and accurately. Kilograms to Stones Convert kilograms to stones quickly and accurately. Stones to Kilograms Convert stones to kilograms quickly and accurately. Feet to Metres Convert feet to metres quickly and accurately. Metres to Feet Convert metres to feet quickly and accurately. Inches to Centimetres Convert inches to centimetres quickly and accurately. Centimetres to Inches Convert centimetres to inches quickly and accurately. Miles to Kilometres Convert miles to kilometres quickly and accurately. Kilometres to Miles Convert kilometres to miles quickly and accurately. Miles per Hour to Kilometres per Hour Convert miles per hour to kilometres per hour quickly and accurately. Kilometres per Hour to Miles per Hour Convert kilometres per hour to miles per hour quickly and accurately. Litres to US Gal"
