welfare.autos,0,"Mystic Vault — 10 Second Prelude Mystic Vault — 10 Second Prelude MYSTIC VAULT 0% MYSTIC VAULT EN CN ✦ THE PRELUDE XII VI IX III 10 SECONDS A whispered invitation awaits... Something extraordinary is about to surface Rewards automatically distributed after countdown Scroll to explore ✦ THE COLLECTION Icons of Eternity Timeless masterpieces that define the art of mechanical precision. Limited Edition Calibre Chronograph Hand-wound mechanical movement, 42-hour power reserve. Icon Perpetual Calendar Self-winding with moon phase, 288 components. Heritage Grande Classique Ultra-thin 8.5mm, rose gold case, enamel dial. Masterpiece Flying Tourbillon Open-worked skeleton, hand-engraved bridges. ✦ CHRONOLOGY A Century of Masters From the first atelier to the modern era of precision engineering. 1839 The Founding A small workshop in the Swiss Jura mountains begins crafting precision timepieces by hand. 1892 First Patent Revolutionary winding mechanism receives international patent, setting new industry standards. 1925 Art Deco Era Iconic tank-shaped models capture the spirit of the Roaring Twenties. 1969 Automatic Revolution Launch of the first self-winding chronograph movement, a milestone in horology. 1999 Millennium Collection Award-winning skeletonised tourbillon captures the world's attention. 2024 Modern Legacy Continuing the tradition of haute horlogerie with cutting-edge innovation. ✦ SAVOIR-FAIRE The Craft Within Every movement tells a story of hundreds of hours of meticulous handcraftsmanship. Hand Assembly Each movement assembled by a single master watchmaker over 120 hours. Geneva Stripes Hand-finished côtes de Genève on every bridge, visible through the sapphire caseback. Thermal Bluing Screws and hands achieve their blue hue through precise flame heating, no paint. Jewel Bearings Natural rubies used as bearings to reduce friction at pivot points of the gear train. ✦ COMPANION Objects of Distinction Refined accessories that complement the art of fine timekeeping. Alligator Leather Strap Hand-stitched, cognac brown, 18mm buckle. Automatic Winder Acacia wood, silent motor, programmable rotation. Presentation Case Leather-wrapped, silk interior, limited edition. ✦ TERMS Event Rules Each participant is limited to one (1) prize per person, regardless of entry method. Prizes are shipped worldwide. No destination is excluded from delivery. Winners will be contacted via the email provided within 7 business days after the event. All prizes are authentic brand-new items with original manufacturer warranty. Mystic Vault reserves the right to verify eligibility and void fraudulent entries. ✦ MYSTIC VAULT ✦ Where time becomes treasure Claim in 10 s ✦ CONGRATULATIONS You've Been Selected Complete the form below to claim your exclusive prize ✦ ICON Grande Classique Full Name * Please enter your full name Email Address * Please enter a valid email address Shipping Address * Please enter a complete address (min. 8 characters) SUBMIT Your information will only be used for prize delivery. Submission Received Thank you! Our team will contact you within 7 business days to coordinate prize delivery."
